{
  "_comment": [
    "Which inference enclaves this box will send mail to. Read by",
    "backend/integrations/inference_attestation.py; committed, so authorizing",
    "an image is a reviewed diff rather than a runtime decision.",
    "",
    "mode: 'required' verifies the provider's TDX quote before make_client()",
    "returns anything for a confidential provider. 'dev-insecure' skips the",
    "check and is refused unless measurements is empty -- see Policy.mode().",
    "",
    "measurements: one entry per authorized image. 'scope' names the provider",
    "the entry authorizes, so a pin for one model does not silently authorize",
    "another. Only mr_td and rt_mr0-3 are matched; compose_hash and",
    "os_image_hash are recorded so a diff says what changed. A null field is an",
    "explicit statement that the register is not pinned; mr_td may never be.",
    "",
    "rt_mr3 is the app: it moves when the provider redeploys the model's",
    "container, which NEAR does without announcing it. That is the pin that",
    "will fail first, and failing is the point -- re-pin with",
    "  python -m backend.integrations.inference_attestation <provider>",
    "read the diff, and commit it. mr_td and rt_mr0-2 are the dstack base image",
    "and move only on a platform upgrade.",
    "",
    "Recorded 2026-08-05 against dstack-nvidia-0.5.5, app_id",
    "2c0a0c96cb6dbd659bf1446e2f3fce58172ff91b."
  ],
